    "text": "By Dennis Spellman ,\n18 hours ago FORT BEND COUNTY, Texas (Covering Katy News) — Crews have begun clearing land for a $104 million swiftwater rescue training facility that will be one of the world's most advanced urban flood training centers and one of the only dedicated facilities of its kind in Texas. The 27-acre property... Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
